Lint Sounio source code

Usage: souc-linux-x86_64 lint [OPTIONS] <PATH>

Arguments:
  <PATH>  Input file (or directory)

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>  Output format (text, json, sarif) [default: text]
      --deny-warnings    Treat warnings as errors
      --allow <LINT>     Allow specific lint (e.g., --allow unused_variable)
      --warn <LINT>      Warn for specific lint
      --deny <LINT>      Deny specific lint
      --fix              Fix issues automatically where possible
  -v, --verbose          Enable verbose output
  -h, --help             Print help
